<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.rafadono.SudoVerse</id>
  <name>SudoVerse</name>
  <summary>Unified, multi-platform Sudoku game with 8 variants</summary>
  <metadata_license>FSFAP</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.rafadono">
    <name>rafadono</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      SudoVerse is a Sudoku game built on a shared TypeScript engine, with native
      support for Classic, Diagonal (X), Killer, Hyper (Windoku), Jigsaw
      (Irregular), Sandwich, Thermo, and Arrow Sudoku variants. Includes a
      backtracking solver, procedural puzzle generator, hints, and English and
      Spanish localization.
    </p>
  </description>
